---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><title>Privacy policy | DD — Didde-Mie Lykke From</title></head>
  <body>
    <header class="legal-header"><a class="wordmark" href="/">DD<span>.</span><small>DIDDE-MIE LYKKE FROM</small></a><a href="/#contact">CONTACT ↗</a></header>
    <main class="legal-main"><span class="section-index">DD / INFORMATION</span><h1>PRIVACY<br /><span>POLICY.</span></h1><p class="legal-date">Last updated 25 September 2026</p>
      <div class="legal-content">
        <p>This policy explains how the DD website handles personal data when you visit the site, play a film, or send an inquiry.</p>
        <section><h2>1. Controller</h2><p>DD Production, CVR no. 42234958, Rathsacksvej 3, 3., 1862 Frederiksberg C, Denmark. For privacy requests, email <a href="mailto:contact@didde-mie.com">contact@didde-mie.com</a>.</p></section>
        <section><h2>2. Data and purposes</h2><ul><li><strong>Contact inquiries:</strong> We collect your name, email address, topic and message to reply. The legal basis is GDPR Article 6(1)(b) for a possible engagement or Article 6(1)(f), our legitimate interest in answering other inquiries. The form sends data to the TTD Studio server, which routes it through our email provider.</li><li><strong>Site operation:</strong> The hosting provider may process IP addresses and technical request data to serve and secure the site. The legal basis is Article 6(1)(f), our legitimate interest in operating a secure website.</li><li><strong>External media:</strong> One campaign image loads from Storyblok, which receives the normal browser request. YouTube is contacted only when you choose to play a film on this page. YouTube may then receive your IP address and place or read cookies or similar identifiers according to its own settings. External profile and source links open their providers' sites when clicked.</li></ul><p>Please do not include sensitive personal data in the inquiry field. You need to provide your name, email and message for us to answer via the form.</p></section>
        <section><h2>3. Recipients and transfers</h2><p>Relevant people working with DD, the website host, the TTD Studio server and our email provider may process inquiry or technical data. YouTube and Storyblok act under their own terms when their content loads. We will verify the final provider list, processing agreements and any transfers outside the EU/EEA before launch, and add the transfer basis here if needed.</p></section>
        <section><h2>4. Retention</h2><p>We normally delete inquiries within 12 months of the last relevant contact, unless they become part of a business relationship or a specific dispute. Accounting records for completed work are retained for five years from the end of the relevant financial year. The hosting log retention period will be added after the deployment setup is confirmed.</p></section>
        <section><h2>5. Your rights</h2><p>You may request access, correction, erasure, restriction and, where applicable, data portability. You may object to processing based on legitimate interests. These rights depend on the circumstances, and legally required records cannot always be deleted immediately. Contact us at the address above. You can complain to the <a href="https://www.datatilsynet.dk/borger/klage-til-datatilsynet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Danish Data Protection Agency</a>.</p></section>
        <section><h2>6. Cookies and similar technologies</h2><p>We will publish a separate, verified technology list and consent controls before adding optional analytics, advertising or embedded services that require consent. Playing a YouTube film initiates a connection to YouTube; choose an external YouTube link instead if you prefer to visit it directly. The final cookie information will state purposes, providers and lifetimes, and let you change any consent you give.</p></section>
        <section><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>We update this policy when features or providers change. The date above shows the latest revision.</p></section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} DD Production</span><a href="/privacy">PRIVACY POLICY</a><span class="footer-credit"><span>Designed by</span><span class="footer-credit-logo" role="img" aria-label="Memory(One)"></span></span></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
